    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about the money though. it's the shame. i look at my family and i just feel like a burden, like a black hole. they'd have to deal with the lawyers, the debt, the mess i made. if i'm just gone, eventually it'll all settle and they can just move on. isn't it better to just stop the bleeding before it ruins everyone else too?",
